          "end": 3.98,
          "relative_start": 0.08,
          "relative_end": 3.98,
          "en": "What's coming next for Cuba? Catcher, Caleb, still in haunches?",
          "zh": "古巴接下来会怎样？",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "古巴"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "Cuba"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "start": 3.98,
          "end": 11.58,
          "relative_start": 3.98,
          "relative_end": 11.58,
          "en": "I just can't tell you that. We've got options all over the map. Perhaps no other nation epitomizes Cold War politics more than Cuba.",
          "zh": "我无法告诉你。我们有很多选择。也许没有哪个国家比古巴更能代表冷战政治。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "冷战政治"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "Cold War politics"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "start": 11.58,
          "end": 17.58,
          "relative_start": 11.58,
          "relative_end": 17.58,
          "en": "When you look for a country that's, let's say, punched above its weight on a global stage, Cuba should be on the list.",
          "zh": "说到在全球舞台上影响力超出体量的国家，古巴应该上榜。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "影响力超出体量"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "punched above its weight"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "start": 17.58,
          "end": 25.58,
          "relative_start": 17.58,
          "relative_end": 25.58,
          "en": "Cuba and the United States by default of their geography have always had some kind of economic relationship.",
          "zh": "古巴和美国因地理原因，一直有某种经济关系。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "经济关系"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "economic relationship"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "start": 25.58,
          "end": 28.88,
          "relative_start": 25.58,
          "relative_end": 28.88,
          "en": "When we had prohibition in the United States, Cuba became a haven.",
          "zh": "美国禁酒令时期，古巴成了美国游客的天堂。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "禁酒令"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "prohibition"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "start": 28.88,
          "end": 33.28,
          "relative_start": 28.88,
          "relative_end": 33.28,
          "en": "For American tourists. Cuba is just not even miles south of Florida.",
          "zh": "古巴距佛罗里达仅不到100英里。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "佛罗里达"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "Florida"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 7,
          "start": 33.28,
          "end": 38.58,
          "relative_start": 33.28,
          "relative_end": 38.58,
          "en": "It's in the heart of the Caribbean. It's been seen as kind of a strategic platform for U.S. rivals.",
          "zh": "它位于加勒比海心脏，被视为美国对手的战略平台。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "战略平台"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "strategic platform"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 8,
          "start": 38.58,
          "end": 45.38,
          "relative_start": 38.58,
          "relative_end": 45.38,
          "en": "The U.S. has had a broad trade embargo on Cuba since shortly after the revolution in the 1960s.",
          "zh": "自1960年代革命后不久，美国就对古巴实施广泛贸易禁运。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "贸易禁运"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "trade embargo"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 9,
          "start": 45.38,
          "end": 53.38,
          "relative_start": 45.38,
          "relative_end": 53.38,
          "en": "Cuba is ruled by a single party, the Cuban Communist Party, and it controls the legislature, controls the military, controls all facets of society.",
          "zh": "古巴由古巴共产党一党统治，控制立法、军队和社会各方面。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "一党统治"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "single party"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 10,
          "start": 54.38,
          "end": 62.38,
          "relative_start": 54.38,
          "relative_end": 62.38,
          "en": "But the socialist idealism that burst Cuba has grown to a halt, literally running out of gas.",
          "zh": "但古巴的社会主义理想已停滞不前，几乎耗尽了燃料。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "社会主义理想"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "socialist idealism"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 11,
          "start": 62.38,
          "end": 68.38,
          "relative_start": 62.38,
          "relative_end": 68.38,
          "en": "There is a dire jet fuel shortage in Cuba. The U.S. is moving to cut off the country's oil supply.",
          "zh": "古巴面临严重的航空燃油短缺。美国正着手切断该国的石油供应。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "航空燃油短缺"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "jet fuel shortage",
            "cut off the country's oil supply"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 12,
          "start": 68.38,
          "end": 72.88,
          "relative_start": 68.38,
          "relative_end": 72.88,
          "en": "The crippling blackouts and a teetering economy have sparked unrest on the island.",
          "zh": "严重的停电和摇摇欲坠的经济引发了岛上的动荡。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "停电"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "crippling blackouts",
            "teetering economy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 13,
          "start": 72.88,
          "end": 76.38,
          "relative_start": 72.88,
          "relative_end": 76.38,
          "en": "We have an unprecedented degree of suffering on the island.",
          "zh": "岛上正经历前所未有的苦难。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "前所未有的苦难"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "unprecedented degree of suffering"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 14,
          "start": 76.38,
          "end": 79.38,
          "relative_start": 76.38,
          "relative_end": 79.38,
          "en": "The Trump administration has taken a hard line.",
          "zh": "特朗普政府采取了强硬立场。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "强硬立场"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "hard line"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 15,
          "start": 79.38,
          "end": 86.38,
          "relative_start": 79.38,
          "relative_end": 86.38,
          "en": "Cuba has always posed an effort to dirty threat. Tonight, the Justice Department unsealing an indictment against former Cuban President Raul Castro.",
          "zh": "古巴一直构成威胁。今晚，司法部公布了对古巴前总统劳尔·卡斯特罗的起诉书。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "起诉书",
            "劳尔·卡斯特罗"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "unsealing an indictment",
            "Raul Castro"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 16,
          "start": 86.38,
          "end": 89.38,
          "relative_start": 86.38,
